        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 3478/42 42\" Long Contemporary Rectangular Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>Unique design custom made door handle for entry doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-3478-42_size.gif?v=1704442274\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions 3478/42 Door Pull size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/20-inch-pryor-aluminum-pull-first-impressions-pry02020\"><b>20 Inch Contemporary Rectangular Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 3478/42-US28 Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers (distance between the 2 mounting holes): 32\" C/C</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Aluminum</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts thru the door). Optional Surface mounting or Back to Back mounting available (Pulls bolt to each other - Requires 2 door pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
